# ==============================================================================
# ThreadPoint Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend API URL (Required for Separate Frontend Deployment on Render)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Development:
#   Leave blank ("") or comment out -> Vite proxy in vite.config.js automatically
#   proxies `/api` to `http://localhost:5000`.
#
# Production on Render Static Site:
#   Set this to your live Render Backend Web Service URL (WITHOUT trailing slash).
#   Example: https://threadpoint-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID for Google Identity Services (GIS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where to obtain your Google Client ID:
# 1. Open Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Click "Create Credentials" -> "OAuth Client ID"
# 3. Application Type: "Web application"
# 4. Under "Authorized JavaScript origins", add:
#    - http://localhost:5173
#    - http://127.0.0.1:5173
#    - https://your-frontend-app.onrender.com   (for Render production)
# 5. Copy the generated Client ID and paste below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com"
